1694
02:40:12,366 --> 02:40:15,876
And that's exactly why we'll use Expo API routes.

1695
02:40:16,622 --> 02:40:20,996
Basically, Expo app requests a stream token API route.

1696
02:40:21,422 --> 02:40:31,556
Then the Expo API route generates that token securely, server-side, the client receives the token, and then stream SDK joins the call using that token.

1697
02:40:31,824 --> 02:40:33,264
Similar to Next.js.

