1923
03:02:13,006 --> 03:02:26,020
Since the project uses clerk but has no clerk backend installed, the fix requires to verify a clerk JWT from the authorization header using Node's crypto create public key against clerk JWK's.

1924
03:02:26,222 --> 03:02:30,020
And then on the client side, send that clerk session and verify it.

1925
03:02:30,382 --> 03:02:37,744
